        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;b&gt;Willow — PROPOSED, v0.6 · 2026-08-29&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#888888&quot;&gt;b17: WGRV1  ΔΣ=42&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;An opinion, not a measurement. 44 repos across 8 org folders as they stand, placed by what each org is &lt;i&gt;for&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;v0.4 (2026-07-20) predates the org split entirely and shows one flat &quot;Dev Repos — ~/github (60 repos)&quot;. v0.5 measured the plumbing. This one argues about shape.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;green = right place today&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&quot;#b97700&quot;&gt;amber = works, wrong home&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&quot;#c62828&quot;&gt;red = should move&lt;/font&gt; · purple = law · &lt;font color=&quot;#1565c0&quot;&gt;blue = product&lt;/font&gt; · grey = not ours" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="86" width="1500" x="40" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wsband" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;THE WORKSPACE — outside ~/github, and mostly unversioned&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
