        <mxCell id="org_dns" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Die-Namic-Systems&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;i&gt;verification&lt;/i&gt;  (2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;nestor&lt;/font&gt; — has a human checked this?&lt;br&gt;dotgithub&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;✓ .nestor now lives here too (2026-08-28)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;one repo, and it is the one the covenant runs on&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
