        <mxCell id="org_tp" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;terpsi-programs&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;i&gt;where the patterns were proved&lt;/i&gt;  (2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;terpsi-music&lt;/font&gt; · dotgithub&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;✓ rule 14 rungs · Envelope crossing, forgery-tested&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;a music repo holds the fleet&#39;s lane-crossing type&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="380" x="520" y="490" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="org_fp" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;forge-play&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;i&gt;the workshop face&lt;/i&gt;  (2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;Forge&lt;/font&gt; · dotgithub&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b97700&quot;&gt;◐ calibration_ledger written, never called&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b97700&quot;&gt;◐ ~/.forge does not exist — nothing recorded yet&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="400" x="930" y="490" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZztjVmoO0UOpcqSakNDw-18" edge="1" parent="1" source="org_safe" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="org_fp" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="org_safe" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#1565c0;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;safe-app-store-public&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;i&gt;the product layer&lt;/i&gt;  (43 apps, 1 repo)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c62828&quot;&gt;✗ sits at ~/github top level, not in an org&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c62828&quot;&gt;✗ remote = rudi193-cmd/safe-app-store — a personal account&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;ai-game-master · the-table · law-gazelle · story-timeline · the-forge&lt;br&gt;marching-arts · oakenscrolls-office · utety-chat · ask-jeles · +34&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b97700&quot;&gt;◐ ask-jeles is a husk — the work became a federated server&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="940" x="1360" y="490" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="propband" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;WHAT I THINK SHOULD CHANGE — five moves, in dependency order&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="900" x="40" y="650" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;1 · The live box moves to the vault&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#c62828&quot;&gt;the v0.4 target, still ✗&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;$WILLOW_HOME is ALREADY a git repo — &lt;b&gt;rudi193-cmd/willow-config&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;So this is not &quot;put the box under version control&quot;. The box is already&lt;br&gt;versioned, into a personal-account repo that is not the data vault and&lt;br&gt;not in any org. That is the actual defect.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Move:&lt;/b&gt; $WILLOW_HOME → ~/sean-data-vault/.willow&lt;br&gt;Postgres → dumps in the vault, live cluster stays a system service&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;keys stay 0600 and gitignored — provision.sh already assumes this&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c62828&quot;&gt;⚠ the Kart bind MUST land first, or every task reads an empty store&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="560" x="40" y="680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#1565c0;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;2 · safe-app-store gets an org&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;43 apps, the entire product layer, on a personal account at the&lt;br&gt;top level of ~/github. Every other face has an org.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;It is also the layer v0.4 got most wrong, and the layer a new&lt;br&gt;user actually touches. If the box is ever more than one person&lt;br&gt;this is the first thing that has to not be &lt;i&gt;yours&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b97700&quot;&gt;◐ and cull: ask-jeles is a husk, the-forge is half-promoted&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="540" x="630" y="680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;3 · The transcripts become visible&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;~/.claude is 144 MB and NOTHING on this box can read it.&lt;br&gt;Not the corpus (extracts .py and .md from git checkouts),&lt;br&gt;not codebase-memory, not Nestor.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;43 sessions · 719 messages you typed · 20,141 words.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;The full vision appears in exactly 3 of them.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c62828&quot;&gt;The corpus holds 8,340 claims about what the code does&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c62828&quot;&gt;and 0 about why any of it exists.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="540" x="1200" y="680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;4 · The Nest gets drained&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4.1 GB on the Desktop, no repo, no index.&lt;br&gt;FLEET_PLACEMENT calls it a &quot;runtime drop zone&quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;nest_intake_scan · nest_promote · nest_digest&lt;br&gt;all exist on the hub. Nothing runs them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b97700&quot;&gt;A drop zone nothing drains is a silo with&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b97700&quot;&gt;better manners.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="530" x="1770" y="680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;5 · One archive, not five&lt;/b&gt;  ·  ~/github-archive-greenfield · -willow · -grove · ~/github/archive/&lt;br&gt;Four trees outside ~/github, retirement notes inside it, and 2.4 MB of architecture that nobody could find for a day because the directory was classified by its parent.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;Proposal: archives land in the vault under archive-migration/&lt;date&gt;/ with a README naming what moved and what deliberately did not — the shape already used on 2026-08-28.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="2260" x="40" y="940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cmp" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;COMPARED TO WHAT WAS PULLED FROM THE ARCHIVED willow REPO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;v0.1&lt;/b&gt; (~/Documents, never committed anywhere) · &lt;b&gt;v0.2&lt;/b&gt; · &lt;b&gt;v0.3-full&lt;/b&gt; · &lt;b&gt;v0.4-full&lt;/b&gt; 2026-07-20 — all predate the org split.&lt;br&gt;They draw &lt;i&gt;one&lt;/i&gt; box: &quot;Dev Repos — ~/github (60 repos): willow · willow-2.0 · willow-mcp · kartikeya · safe-app-store-publ…&quot;. Flat. No orgs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;What the stale versions still get right:&lt;/b&gt; the three-key egress gate · what the operator holds · lanes are mutually sealed ·&lt;br&gt;willow_web_* retiring to Jeles · and the (USER)-data-vault target, which they marked ✗ six weeks ago and is still ✗.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;What they cannot see:&lt;/b&gt; eight orgs · 44 repos · Jeles as a federated server rather than a SAFE app · a personal lane ·&lt;br&gt;nestor with its own org and home · 43 apps where they show a handful · and that the live box is a git repo pointing at the wrong remote.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;The diagrams were not wrong. They were unfinished, and then unreachable — left in an archive under a directory named for the repo it lived in,&lt;br&gt;when its contents were about everything except that repo.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="2260" x="40" y="1060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a1" edge="1" parent="1" source="org_wm" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#c62828;fontColor=#c62828;fontSize=11;" target="ws_vault" value="the box belongs here">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
